Subject: BananaDS: route DS Rumble Pak callbacks through OS force feedback

Attach a virtual Rumble Pak on the Duo Lite when its gamepad exposes FF_RUMBLE.
Use bounded kernel effects, close-owned cleanup and the OS motor gate. Keep
other handhelds unchanged and allow input.rumble_pak=false for game overrides.

--- a/bananads/src/platform.cpp
+++ b/bananads/src/platform.cpp
